---
title: "Gustavs länkblogg"
layout: fragment.njk
type: page
description: "En samling länkar till allt intressant jag surfat in på, på webben."
permalink: /linkblog/
feed: /linkblog.xml
eleventyComputed:
    meta:
        author:
            name: "{{ metadata.author.name }}"
    published: "{{ date }}"
    modified: "{% if updateDate %}{{ updateDate | iso8601 }}{% endif %}"
---
<ul class="post-list">
	{% for post in inoreader.linkblog %}<li class="post-list__item">
		<a id="{{ post.url | hashString}}" class="post-link" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title | safe }}</a> <span class="post-metadata">{{ post.source.name | safe }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
